| **Ignored/Disabled Test** | ✅ Clean | No `[Ignore]` or `Skip` attributes. |
| **Duplicate Assert** | ✅ Clean | No identical assertion duplicated. |
| **Lazy Test** | ✅ Clean | Tests share `Insert` for setup but test different behaviors. |
| **Constructor Init** | ✅ Clean | Uses `[TestInitialize]`, not a constructor. |
| **Default Test** | ✅ Clean | Class is meaningfully named. |
| **Redundant Print** | ✅ Clean | No `Console.WriteLine` calls. |
