## 🏆 Well-Written Tests (Smell-Free)

These four methods are cleanly structured — clear arrange/act/assert, appropriate assertions, no conditional logic:

- **`UpdateUser_ModifiesExistingRecord`** — concise, focused, good assert.
- **`DeleteUser_RemovesFromDatabase`** — single assertion perfectly validates the behavior.
- **`ListUsers_ReturnsAllInserted`** — count is self-documenting; `CollectionAssert` is a nice touch.
- **`InsertUser_ConcurrentInserts_MaintainsIntegrity`** — clean async pattern, single focused assertion.

